听话的下属一样，但他也很关心阿洛伊斯。\n\n请画一幅他们早上一起准备上班的可爱插图。想法包括他们一起刷牙，阿洛伊斯给加布做早餐等。\n\n预期用途：SNS、OC 活动、打印，仅供个人观看\n\n谢谢\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Zovag9J6SWh0jPvzh-SwAMHRSSJlVgUV?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Okari_001/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f4d10a6/uploads/origins/16d10443-97d4-4947-8d0a-919d2a49786b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8daa6c8966ebca1166ceec0a59886b35", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1f4d10a6/uploads/origins/16d10443-97d4-4947-8d0a-919d2a49786b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8daa6c8966ebca1166ceec0a59886b35, https://si.imgix.net/1f4d10a6/uploads/origins/16d10443-97d4-4947-8d0a-919d2a49786b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bedd2e23e257e34cc5b462248e0ed54 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1f4d10a6/uploads/origins/16d10443-97d4-4947-8d0a-919d2a49786b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b27ca82750a94c8ff07f95b63ae7d996 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "您好！我对您的艺术风格很感兴趣！您能画我朋友的 VTuber 角色吗？您能画出与我在参考文件夹中的作品相似的构图吗？\n\n如果可以的话，请附上一个图层分离的 .psd 文件和我的 VTuber 角色的透明 .png 文件。谢谢！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZweDSGwo1xY-TEs0GaPLjbHIcAhYY1d5?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Okari_001/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9bf8e362/uploads/origins/21fb962d-ff3c-4dba-8945-b51a95789c37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ae963576f5de8520b22f530d8159f95", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9bf8e362/uploads/origins/21fb962d-ff3c-4dba-8945-b51a95789c37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8ae963576f5de8520b22f530d8159f95, https://si.imgix.net/9bf8e362/uploads/origins/21fb962d-ff3c-4dba-8945-b51a95789c37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c312906eff82b5904d1a63092e48f31 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9bf8e362/uploads/origins/21fb962d-ff3c-4dba-8945-b51a95789c37?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d607488e9ca1e298acc7fe563f04e0fb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好！很高兴再次见到你！\n\n非常感谢你之前提供的公狐狸插图！\n\n我想再要一幅狐狸公仔的插图。\n\n我可以要求为穿着清洁工或厨房女佣制服的男狐狸插图吗？或许可以戴头巾？\n\n赤壁狐狸的主人把赤壁狐狸当作宠物，而不是伙伴。\n\n背景是蓝带狐狸会给赤壁狐狸穿上衣服，以换取更多的食物。\n\n赤壁狐参考资料。\n\n赤壁狐狸\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1n918v_IQ6Olf7cIcufvXbxK4r2Kgw6eC/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐狸和主人。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ntzakB4HyQAfecayZQc2tuCkNPWdEcPP/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐狸精和主人。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1bfTZWQQCL-iQNcjUAODaVyBz6J3xumgC/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐人\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/111rnL_gjH2-6vEuo0PIgF-TuRr7Vu96-/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n什么都可以。我把所有细节都留给你。\n\n非常感谢您的阅读！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Okari_001/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/85a66444/uploads/origins/88c734d4-891e-4f16-afde-daaa72e531c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8d413b19a2042e718c160bc731516b7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/85a66444/uploads/origins/88c734d4-891e-4f16-afde-daaa72e531c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8d413b19a2042e718c160bc731516b7, https://si.imgix.net/85a66444/uploads/origins/88c734d4-891e-4f16-afde-daaa72e531c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=837cd38e790058cdc9727b3bb8ea9e7c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/85a66444/uploads/origins/88c734d4-891e-4f16-afde-daaa72e531c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=86cc57b91260bc28f98f25a46a5c52af 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好！很高兴见到你\n\n我喜欢你的克莫画，所以想请你画一幅克莫类型的画。\n\n我想要一幅男性赤狐形象的插图。\n\n背景：男赤壁狐是一个寡言少语的人，曾经是一名军士，但被诅咒变成了一只赤壁狐。现在他们用劳动换取食物残渣。当他们获得足够的能量时，可以短暂地变成人形。他们还可以作为精灵漂浮在空中，以节省能量。\n\n赤壁狐参考资料。\n\n赤壁狐狸\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1n918v_IQ6Olf7cIcufvXbxK4r2Kgw6eC/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐狸和主人。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1ntzakB4HyQAfecayZQc2tuCkNPWdEcPP/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐狸精和主人。\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1bfTZWQQCL-iQNcjUAODaVyBz6J3xumgC/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n赤壁狐人\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/111rnL_gjH2-6vEuo0PIgF-TuRr7Vu96-/view?usp=drivesdk\n\n什么都可以。我把所有细节都留给你。\n\n非常感谢您的阅读！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}